sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 用户
    participant S as server
    participant A as Agent
    S->>A: connection_open
    U->>S: user_message
    S-->>U: event: diagnosis
    S-->>U: event: plan
    loop step 1..N
        S-->>U: event: step
        S-->>U: event: presentation（60字分片）
    end
    S-->>U: event: checkpoint
    S-->>U: event: evaluation
    S-->>U: event: adjustment
    S-->>U: event: done
